; and 3. Whether the parties intend to mediate per LCR 39.1 and, if so, when the parties expect to complete mediation.The deadlines below may be extended only by court order. Any request for extension of these deadlines should be made by email to Courtroom Deputy Clerk Kadya Peter at kadya_peter@wawd.uscourts.gov. The parties who have appeared in this matter must meet and confer before contacting the Court to request an extension. If this case involves claims that are exempt from the requirements of FRCP 26(a) and 26(f), please notify the Courtroom Deputy Clerk. Please note: Initial Disclosures are not to be filed. FRCP 26(f) Conference Deadline is 9/14/2023, Initial Disclosure Deadline is 9/21/2023, Joint Status Report due by 9/28/2023. (KMP) (Entered: 08/03/2023)", "tags": []}, {"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/docket-entries/402951533/", "id": 402951533, "docket": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/dockets/69183756/", "recap_documents": [{"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/recap-documents/412933191/", "id": 412933191, "tags": [], "absolute_url": "", "date_created": "2024-09-20T18:13:52.980437-07:00", "date_modified": "2024-09-20T18:13:52.986894-07:00", "sha1": "", "page_count": null, "file_size": null, "filepath_local": null, "filepath_ia": "", "ia_upload_failure_count": null, "thumbnail": null, "thumbnail_status": 0, "plain_text": "", "ocr_status": null, "date_upload": null, "document_number": "", "attachment_number": null, "pacer_doc_id": "", "is_available": false, "is_free_on_pacer": null, "is_sealed": null, "document_type": 1, "description": "", "acms_document_guid": ""}], "date_created": "2024-09-20T18:13:52.970708-07:00", "date_modified": "2024-09-20T18:13:52.970715-07:00", "date_filed": "2023-08-03", "time_filed": null, "entry_number": null, "recap_sequence_number": "2023-08-03.001", "pacer_sequence_number": null, "description": "Attorneys Jeremy F. Wood and Sieu K. Che added for Defendants Vinmar I